    i++;
    if(i % 2 == 0)
        continue;
    cout << i << " ";
}
```

This loop will iterate through the values 1 to 10, but when `i` is even, the `continue` statement will skip that iteration and move on to the next iteration. The output of this loop will be:

```
1 3 5 7 9
```

